.vercel
.env*

# Installers never live here. Vercel refuses any single file over 100 MB and
# the macOS dmg is ~159 MB, so both installers are GitHub release assets that
# /NiedenthalLabSuite*.{exe,dmg} redirect to (see vercel.json). This rule is
# only a guard against someone dropping a build in here by hand and committing
# 150 MB to the repo.
*.dmg
*.exe
*.msi
